    "model_details": "max_map_action_space",
    "model_description": "MLP policy (MlpPolicy) with action masking via sb3-contrib, using a fixed action space sized to the largest campaign map (action_space_hexes=384) so a single model can play every level regardless of the maps it trained on.  Reworked self-relative reward: per-step shaping on the deltas of the agent's own ownership percentage and economy (4*farms - trees), measured against its previous state rather than opponents; truncation penalised as heavily as a loss. Trained via a manual level-by-level curriculum with win-rate early stopping and resume-from-checkpoint.",
